    "chunk_text": "We have been able to kindle an unfading dawn of hope in the hearts of hundreds of thousands of our people. I wish to recall that we are unconditionally fulfilling the expectations of the noble trust that the entire people of this country placed in us two years ago.\n\nIt is to make the Sri Lankan identity a symbol of intelligence, virtue and excellence. Creating a true renaissance through all of these is the core objective of our Budget. This is because ushering in a renaissance era is not merely a change in economic indicators or statistics, but it is a broad social transformation that brings about a change in people's thinking, knowledge, attitudes and behaviour, and breathes new life into the cultural, intellectual and artistic life of the country.\n\nWe must all come together and, through a collective people's intervention, take this country forward towards the development that we, as Sri Lanka in the 21st Century, should have already achieved.\n\nOn this journey, the first thing we had to do was to bring about a fundamental transformation in the political culture. For the first time in history since Independence, the people of this country gave us the mandate to establish a genuine people's governance in place of a government administration that had been in the hands of a few corrupt elite families.\n\nWhat we need is not merely a Government that collects revenue, but a Government that delivers value to the people for every tax rupee it collects. What we need is not a large Government machinery, but an efficient and transparent Government machinery that is accountable to the people.\n\nOur policy is to recognize, at every level of governance, that the true owners of public money are the citizens of this country."
  },
