    "md5": "1c7de62be89bd18dc845fd5f5f44cc86",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1810,
    "chunk_text": "Hon. Deputy Chairperson of Committees, I rise today to speak in support of the Appropriation Bill, 2027, a Budget that does not merely manage numbers on a ledger, but also charts a decisive, disciplined and compassionate course from economic survival to genuine national revival.\n\n525 526\n\n[\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd2\u0da5 \u0d85\u0db1\u0dd4\u0dc2\u0dca\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0dad\u0dd2\u0dbd\u0d9a\u0dbb\u0dad\u0dca\u0db1 \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dca\u0db8\u0dd2\u0dba]\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0dad\u0dd2\u0dbd\u0d9a\u0dbb\u0dad\u0dca\u0db1 \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dca\u0db8\u0dd2\u0dba]\n\n2026 \u0daf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dd0 \u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca 13\n\nMadam, you will understand that this country cannot go forward with external and internal shocks. Therefore, we have to have a resilient economy which could withstand external and internal shocks. And, we have shown that we could withstand internal shocks. The massive loss of property due to Cyclone \"Ditwah\" we experienced, which caused nearly US Dollars 3.4 billion worth of damage, we withstood and recovered. Then, of course, after that challenge, our Government was challenged by the war between Iran and America over the Hormuz Strait, and the energy prices are soaring all over the world. People are feeling the pinch, the crunch or whatever name you call it, and some of the people did expect that our country would also suffer due to that, that there will be fuel queues and power cuts. Nothing of that sort happened. In order to compensate for this impact, over Rs. 147 billion has been spent. That is how these subsidies have been given. I heard some of them saying, \u201cGive fuel at the same price you unload it at the port.\u201d Well, we are giving it at a price less than that because we know that we have to absorb the shock. We were able to absorb this shock and will continue with the challenges simply because we have achieved all our revenue targets, which was historical; it has not happened in this country before."
  },
