    "chunk_size_bytes": 1925,
    "chunk_text": "When it comes to poverty alleviation, earlier, poverty was used as a tool for politics. The reason why they did not touch those areas was because they were scared. Now, we are the ones who are reforming and we are not afraid of it. We are explaining to people what poverty means and how we would ensure they are supported and uplifted. Last year, we invested Rs. 25 billion on the Prajashakthi Programme to uplift those communities and in going forward, that is what is going to happen. We are not just throwing money into it. It was their strategy to say that if you are tall, you would get a certain job and if you are short, you would get some other job. Also, if you all wanted to distribute bananas to the people, you put your name on them and distributed. That is what they were doing. That kind of politics is over now. So, we are trying to uplift those people, ensuring that the money we spend goes down to the very roots in improve their lives. That is why we are improving the Sathosa; that is why we are improving the cooperative sector, and that has never happened before.\n\nTherefore, I invite all of you to look at this Budget holistically and support the economy, which will thrive with a growth of 7 per cent within the next few years. Thank you.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0d85\u0da2\u0dd2\u0dad\u0dca \u0db4\u0dd3. \u0db4\u0dd9\u0dbb\u0dda\u0dbb\u0dcf \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b85\u0b9c\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bcd \u0baa\u0bc0. \u0baa\u0bc6\u0bb0\u0bc7\u0bb0\u0bbe)\u0bb0\u0bbe) (The Hon. Ajith P. Perera) Sir, I rise to a point of Order.\n\n\u0db8\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dcf\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dd6\u0daa \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dcf\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0ba4\u0bb2\u0bc8\u0bae\u0bc8\u0ba4\u0bbe\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bcd \u0b89\u0bb1\u0bc1\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bbf\u0ba9\